# Downed state: with SECOND WIND, 0 health downs the player (low, slow, pistol only) and takes the perks, the perk stands the player up, and the next 0 health ends in game over.
tap restart
wait 10
self_revive
expect hud.perks S
until zombies.alive 4 300
until player.downed true 3600
expect player.dead false
expect hud.weapon PISTOL
expect hud.ammo 12 / 48
expect hud.perks
state 00-downed
shot 00-downed
until player.downed false 600
expect player.dead false
expect hud.downed
state 01-stood-up
until game_over.visible true 1200
expect player.dead true
expect player.downed false
expect hud.downed
state 02-game-over
shot 02-game-over
